<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Under Development | Farhan Ali</title>
    <style>
        /* Minimalist Premium Reset */
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        body {
            /* Using modern system fonts for a clean, sharp look */
            font-family: "Inter", -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            color: #111111;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 24px;
            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
            -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 520px;
            animation: fadeUp 0.8s ease-out forwards;
            opacity: 0;
            transform: translateY(10px);
        }

        .badge {
            display: inline-block;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.12em;
            color: #666666;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
            border: 1px solid #e5e5e5;
            padding: 6px 14px;
            border-radius: 50px; /* Slight pill shape for elegance */
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 2.2rem;
            font-weight: 500;
            letter-spacing: -0.03em;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
            color: #000000;
        }

        p {
            font-size: 1.05rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #555555;
            margin-bottom: 36px;
        }

        /* Premium Call to Action Button */
        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: #000000;
            color: #ffffff;
            text-decoration: none;
            padding: 14px 32px;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            font-weight: 500;
            border-radius: 4px;
            border: 1px solid #000000;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .btn:hover {
            background-color: #ffffff;
            color: #000000;
        }

        .footer {
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: #999999;
            margin-top: 48px;
        }

        /* Subtle entrance animation */
        @keyframes fadeUp {
            to {
                opacity: 1;
                transform: translateY(0);
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="badge">Work in Progress</div>
        
        <h1>Under Development</h1>
        
        <p>
            The <strong>library.farhanali.org</strong> platform is currently undergoing a complete rebuild. Thank you for your patience while this new experience is being crafted. 
        </p>

        <a href="https://farhanali.org" class="btn">View Main Portfolio</a>
        
        <div class="footer">&copy; 2026 Farhan Ali. All rights reserved.</div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>